        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBN2015/20, Contemporary Glass Shampoo Shelf</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern design of the brackets on the Nobe Series Shelf makes it perfect for contemporary styled homes. This 20\" glass shelf has concealed screw mounting for a sleek look. It is made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for; and when mounted to the wall, this shampoo shelf will make a ultra fashionable--yet functional--accessory to any bathroom.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2015_20-specifications.gif?v=1704354719\" width=\"597\" height=\"198\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBN2015/20 20 Inch Glass Shampoo Shelf Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBN Nobe Series\"><b>Deltana Nobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Nobe Modern Glass Shampoo Shelf:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc (available in satin nickel or polished chrome finishes) with a glass shelf</li>\r\n<li>Glass Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 21-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 23-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Width: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2015_20.pdf?v=1691095368\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBN2015/20 20 Glass Shampoo Shelf Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 glass shelf, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
