                "description": "Deltana BBN2015/20 20 Modern Glass Shampoo Shelf - The modern design of the brackets on the Nobe Series Shelf makes it perfect for contemporary styled homes. This 20 inch glass shelf has concealed screw mounting for a sleek look. The brackets are available in satin nickel or polished chrome finishes. It is made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for; and when mounted to the wall, this shampoo shelf will make a ultra fashionable--yet functional--accessory to any bathroom.",
